msgid "Proxies"
msgstr "Posrednici"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Predstavljanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Proxies are programs running on a computer that acts a server on the network "
"you are connected to (whether by modem or other means). These programs "
"receive &HTTP; and &FTP; requests, retrieve the relevant files from the "
"internet, and pass them on to the client computer that made the requests."
msgstr ""
"Posrednici su programi koji se izvršavaju na računaru koji posreduju između "
"mreže na koju ste spojeni (bilo preko modema ili neke druge veze) i vašeg "
"kompjutera. Ovi programi prihvataju &HTTP; i &FTP; zahtjeve,  prikupljaju "
"važne dokumente sa interneta, i prosljeđuju ih kompjuteru korisnika koji je "
"podnio zahtjev."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have configured a proxy, &HTTP; and/or &FTP; requests are re-routed "
"through the computer that is acting as a proxy server. However, you can also "
"select specific hosts which should be contacted directly, rather than "
"through the proxy server. If you are on a local network, for example, access "
"to local hosts probably doesn't need to go through a proxy server."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste podesili proxy, &HTTP; i/ili &FTP; zahtjevi će biti ponovo "
"pokrenuti kroz kompjuter koji služi kao proxi server. Međutim, možete "
"također i selektovati određeni host koji će biti direktno kontaktiran, "
"ranije nego proxi server. Ako ste na lokalnoj mreži, na primjer, pristup "
"lokalnom serveru vjerovatno ne zahtijeva prolaz kroz proxi server."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should only need to configure a proxy server if your network "
"administrator requires it (if you are a dial-up user, that would be your "
"internet service provider or <acronym>ISP</acronym>). Otherwise, especially "
"if you are feeling a bit confused about this proxy business, but everything "
"seems to be fine with your internet connection, you don't need to change "
"anything."
msgstr ""
"Trebate postaviti samo proxi server ukoliko to zahtjeva vaš mrežni "
"administrator (ako ste korisnik dial-up veze, to će biti snadbjevač internet "
"veze ili <acronym>ISP</acronym>). Inače, posebno ako se osjećate pomalo "
"zbunjeno proxi poslovima, a sve se čini uredu sa internet vezon, ne trebate "
"ništa mijenjati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note that using proxy servers is optional, but has the benefit or "
"advantage of giving you faster access to data on the internet."
msgstr ""
"Molim Vas imajte u vidu da je korištenje servera posrednika opcionalno, ali "
"pružaju Vam beneficije ili prednost omogućavajući brži pristup podacima na "
"internetu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are uncertain whether or not you need to use a proxy server to "
"connect to the internet, please consult with your internet service "
"provider's setup guide or your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"Ako niste sigurni da li trebate da koristite servere posrednike za "
"konektovanje na internet, molim Vas konsultujte upustvo za korištenje izdato "
"od strane vašeg provajdera internet usluge, ili kontaktirajte administratora "
"sistema."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Use</title>"
msgstr "<title>Koristi</title>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "No Proxy"
msgstr "Bez posrednika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if you do <emphasis>not</emphasis> want to use a proxy "
"server and connect to the Internet directly."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite ovu opciju ako  <emphasis>ne</emphasis> želite da koristiti server "
"posrednik i želite da se konektujete direktno na internet."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have decided to use a proxy, you have several methods to configure "
"the settings for it."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste se odlučili da koristiti posrednika, imate nekoliko metoda da "
"podesite postavke za njega."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "Detect proxy configuration automatically"
msgstr "Prepoznaj automatski konfiguraciju posrednika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want the proxy setup configuration script file to "
"be automatically detected and downloaded."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovu opciju ako želite da se skriptni dokument sa postavkama "
"posrednika automatski detektuje i preuzme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option only differs from the next choice in that it <emphasis>does not</"
"emphasis> require you to supply the location of the configuration script "
"file. Instead, it will be automatically downloaded using <quote>Web Proxy "
"Auto-Discovery</quote> (<acronym>WPAD</acronym>) protocol."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija se razlikuje od sljedeće samo po tome da <emphasis>ne</emphasis> "
"zahtijeva da obezbijedite lokaciju na kojoj se nalazi skriptni dokument. "
"Umjesto toga, on će biti automatski preuzet korištenjem <quote>Web Proxy "
"Auto-Discovery</quote> (<acronym>WPAD</acronym>) protokola."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have a problem using this setup, please consult the <acronym>FAQ</"
"acronym> section at <ulink url=\"http://www.konqueror.org\">http://www."
"konqueror.org</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko imate problema sa korištenjem ovih postavki, molim Vas da pogledate "
"<acronym>FAQ</acronym> odjenjak na <ulink url=\"http://www.konqueror.org"
"\">http://www.konqueror.org</ulink> za više informacija."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use proxy auto configuration URL"
msgstr "Koristite URL za automatsku konfiguracije proxija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if your proxy support is provided through a script file "
"located at a specific address. You can then enter the address in the "
"location text box, or use the <guiicon>folder</guiicon> icon to browse to it."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovu opciju ako je podrška za posrednika omogućena preko skripte "
"koja se nalazi na posebnoj adresi. Možete ili upisati adresu u prostor za "
"tekst lokacije, ili koristiti <guiicon>folder</guiicon> ikonu da je učitate."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use system proxy configuration"
msgstr "Koristi sistemske postavke posrednika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some systems are setup with $<envar>HTTP_PROXY</envar> to allow graphical as "
"well as non-graphical applications to share the same proxy configuration "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Neki sistemi su podešeni pomoću $<envar>HTTP_PROXY</envar> da bi dopustili "
"kako grafičkim, tako i negrafičkim aplikacijama da koriste iste informacije "
"o  postavki posrednika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you know this applies to you, select this option and click on the "
"<guibutton>Auto Detect</guibutton> button to provide the environment "
"variable names used to set the address of the proxy server(s)."
msgstr ""
"Ako znate da se ovo odnosi na Vas, odaberite ovu opciju i kliknite na dugme "
"<guibutton>Automatski detektuj</guibutton> da biste obezbijedili imena "
"varijabli potrebna da se postavi(e) proxi server(i)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Exceptions</guilabel> field enter the environment variable, "
"&eg; $<envar>NO_PROXY</envar>, used to store the addresses of sites for "
"which the proxy server should not be used."
msgstr ""
"U polju <guilabel>Izuzeci</guilabel>  ukucajte varijable okruženja, &eg; "
"$<envar>NO_PROXY</envar>, korištene da se sačuvaju adrese stranica za koje "
"proxi ne bi trebao biti korišten."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <guilabel>Show the value of the environment variables</guilabel> to show "
"the value of an environment variable instead of its name. However it is not "
"possible to edit the values of environment variables in this module."
msgstr ""
"Koristite <guilabel>Prikaži vrijednost varijabli iz okruženja </guilabel> da "
"prikažete vrijednosti varijabli iz okruženja umjesto njihovih imena. Ipak "
"nije moguće mijenjati vrijednosti ovih varijabli u ovom modulu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use manually specified proxy configuration"
msgstr "Koristite ručno odabrane proxi postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The complete addressing information for the proxy includes both the Internet "
"address and a port number. You should enter these into the relevant text "
"boxes. Check <guilabel>Use this proxy server for all protocols</guilabel> to "
"copy the addresses and port of the HTTP proxy server into all other proxy "
"fields, in order to help save some typing."
msgstr ""
"Kompletno adresiranje informacija za proxi uključuje i interneta adresu i "
"broj port-a. Trebate unijeti ove informacije u relevantne pravougaonike za "
"unos teksta. Provjerite<guilabel>Koristi proxi servere za sve protokole</"
"guilabel> da kopirate adrese i port na HTTP proxi serveru u sva ostala polja "
"proxija, da sebe poštedite dodatnog kucanja."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Izuzeci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter a comma separated list of hostnames or ip addresses that should be "
"excluded from using the above proxy settings. If you want to exclude all "
"hosts for a given domain, then simply enter the domain name preceded by a "
"dot. For example, to exclude all hostnames for kde.org, enter <userinput>."
"kde.org</userinput>. Wildcard characters such as <userinput>*</userinput> or "
"<userinput>?</userinput> are not supported and will have no effect. "
"Additionally, you can also enter IP addresses, e.g. 127.0.0.1 and IP "
"addresses with a subnet, e.g. 192.168.0.1/24."
msgstr ""
"Ukucajte listu imena hostova ili IP adresa koje bi trebale biti izbačene iz "
"gornjih proxi postavki, odvoje zarezom. Ako želite da izdvojite sve host-ove "
"za datu domenu, onda jednostavno ukucajte ime domene sa tačkom ispred. Na "
"primjer, da izbacite sva imena host-ova za kde.org, ukucajte <userinput>.kde."
"org</userinput>. Nisu dozvoljeni simboli poput  <userinput>*</userinput> ili "
"<userinput>?</userinput> i oni neće imati nikakvog efekta. Dodatno, možete "
"također unijeti IP adrese, npr. 127.0.0.1 i IP adrese sa podstringom, npr. "
"192.168.0.1/24."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also choose <guilabel>Use proxy settings only for addresses in the "
"Exceptions list</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Također možete odabrati <guilabel>Koristite postavke proxi-ja samo za adrese "
"iz liste izuzetaka</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box to reverse the use of the exception list, &ie; the proxy "
"servers will only be used when the requested &URL; matches one of the "
"addresses listed here."
msgstr ""
"Označite ovaj kvadratić da obrnete korištenje liste izuzetaka, &ie; proxi "
"serveri će biti korišteni samo kada se traženi &URL; poklapa sa nekom od "
"adresa nabrojanih ovdje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This feature is useful if all you need is a proxy to access a few specific "
"sites, for example, an internal intranet. If you have more complex "
"requirements you might want to use a configuration script."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija je korisna ako proxi trebate za pristup samo nekoliko određenih "
"stranica, na primjer, interni internet. Ako imate više kompleksne zahtjeve, "
"možda ćete htjeti koristiti skriptu za konfiguraciju."
